    {
      "id": "6E80AEE1B72E9A54",
      "title": "A Tool Worth Keeping",
      "description": [
        "Build tools from interchangeable parts, then keep improving the same tool. Parts determine material stats and traits.",
        "Follow this chapter for your first tool, repair and modifier. Recipe lookup is available through JEI or EMI. Quest XP rewards are normal player XP; tool XP comes from using the tool.",
        "Already assembled tools count when carried in your inventory. Check this introduction to begin."
      ],
      "icon": {
        "id": "wt_workshop:tool_station"
      },
      "dependencies": [],
