    {
      "id": "6C1E4EA823CAB4D6",
      "title": "Your First Working Pick",
      "description": [
        "Build a pickaxe head, handle and binding from materials available to you, then assemble them in the Tool Station. Wood and other non-metal starter parts do not require a smeltery.",
        "Only a properly assembled Workshop pickaxe counts. Carry an existing assembled pickaxe to complete this step; making another is unnecessary."
      ],
      "icon": {
        "id": "wt_workshop:pickaxe"
      },
      "dependencies": [
