    {
      "id": "66AB120F7AF9D402",
      "title": "Repair, Keep the Progress",
      "description": [
        "Use your tool until it has some wear. Put it in the Tool Station tool slot, then add a material matching its head. Take the repaired result.",
        "Repairs preserve materials, name, XP, modifiers and expansions. This step tracks a real repair performed after installing WT Workshop 0.6."
      ],
      "icon": {
