    {
      "id": "6066FE5A361360F1",
      "title": "Work a Wider Area",
      "description": [
        "Assemble a Hammer, Excavator or Broad Axe using its matching larger parts. Heavy tools consume more materials and durability.",
        "The Hammer and Excavator support area mining. Check the tool tooltip and try them in a safe area. Carry any assembled heavy tool to complete this step."
