    {
      "id": "6AE0C05E91B6648D",
      "title": "Room for an Ability",
      "description": [
        "Reach level 5 on a Workshop tool. By default this adds your first ability slot from leveling, alongside the upgrade slot for that level.",
        "Ability slots support effects such as Mending, Silky or Siphoning. They are separate from upgrade slots, and ingredients must still be supplied."
