    {
      "id": "604E278D75C2C5A6",
      "title": "Make More Room",
      "description": [
        "Craft a Copper Expansion Brace and apply it to an assembled tool. Then work toward Gilded and Astral in order.",
        "Each tier is single use and permanent. Default bonus: one upgrade slot per tier; Astral also adds one ability slot. Expansions cost no existing slot. Sponge removes modifiers while retaining expansions."
